  steps:
    - Pick H in 8-13, W in 15-20, bar_side_len in 3-12, ext_side_len = W - 1 - bar_side_len (>=2)
    - Pick bar_side in {left, right}; place separator column at bar_side_len (if left) or W-1-bar_side_len (if right)
    - Pick sep_color and a disjoint palette of 5-8 bar colors (all non-zero, distinct)
