        * place bars contiguously abutting separator (nearest bar has inner edge at separator-1 or separator+1);
          occasionally insert a 1-cell gap between the nearest bar and separator [rare]
    - Build output by simulating the periodic extension (nearest-first, no-overwrite) on ext_side
    - Input = output with ext_side cleared to 0 (keep separator + bars + bg)
    - Final validation: simulate(input) == output
